{"id": "EUVD-2026-96569", "enisaUuid": "64b43cfa-5649-3d9b-9b4b-bc6f6b180205", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in SysDepartPermissionController that allows any authenticated user to modify department permission records by calling the edit endpoint. Low-privileged attackers can obtain row ids from the unguarded list endpoint and overwrite depart_id, permission_id and data_rule_ids to alter which menus and data rules departments may delegate.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:25", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:01:54", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_depart_permission_edit_put.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/system/controller/SysDepartPermissionController.java#L105-L110", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sys-sysdepartpermission-edit"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108630", "GHSA-vxh9-32jh-rr78"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "dcdaa272-7ae6-3159-939a-cb46ce55183f", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "cdac4762-c71a-3b36-9199-61347f944cd2", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}